usage: c1-oracle.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--work WORK] [--carriers CARRIERS]
                    [--fixtures-dir FIXTURES_DIR] [--oracle-root ORACLE_ROOT]
                    [--json-out JSON_OUT] [--merge-carriers MERGE_CARRIERS]
                    [--receipt RECEIPT] [--only ONLY] [--selftest]
                    [--seat SEAT]

Build the frozen R49-C1 oracle blocks (independent unsquashfs 4.7.5 census +
the committed unblob __output__ expected trees).

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           lane root (default: cwd)
  --work WORK           scratch directory for extractions
  --carriers CARRIERS   carriers.json to read the ids from
  --fixtures-dir FIXTURES_DIR
                        directory holding the carrier fixture bytes
  --oracle-root ORACLE_ROOT
                        committed __output__ tree root (default:
                        <root>/corpus/evidence/round-44/oracle)
  --json-out JSON_OUT   where to write the oracle blocks
  --merge-carriers MERGE_CARRIERS
                        write the oracle blocks into this carriers.json (the
                        'oracle' key of every carrier entry is replaced); the
                        file is rewritten in place
  --receipt RECEIPT     where to write the run receipt
  --only ONLY           restrict to one carrier id (repeatable)
  --selftest            run the built-in self test and exit
  --seat SEAT           seat name for the receipt
